{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, רְמָא","hw":"רְמָא","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">רְמָא</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. cast, throw (</strong>v. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, רָמָה³\" href=\"/BDB,_רָמָה³\", dir=\"rtl\">I. רמה</a> (rare)<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pe.</strong>  Pf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְמוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:17\" href=\"/Daniel.6.17\">Dn 6:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:25\" href=\"/Daniel.6.25\">25</a>; 1 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְמֵ֫ינָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:24\" href=\"/Daniel.3.24\">3:24</a>; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְמִרְמֵא</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:20\" href=\"/Daniel.3.20\">20</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:24\" href=\"/Ezra.7.24\">Ezr 7:24</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>cast</em>, acc. pers. + ל loc. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:24\" href=\"/Daniel.3.24\">Dn 3:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:25\" href=\"/Daniel.6.25\">6:25</a>; acc. pers. om. v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:17\" href=\"/Daniel.6.17\">17</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:20\" href=\"/Daniel.3.20\">3:20</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  fig. <em>throw</em> (burden of) tribute, <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> pers., <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:24\" href=\"/Ezra.7.24\">Ezr 7:24</a>.<br><strong>Peʿîl</strong>  Pf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְמִיו</span> (W<sup>CG 225</sup>): <strong>1.</strong>  <em>were cast</em>, subj. pers. c. ל loc., <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:21\" href=\"/Daniel.3.21\">Dn 3:21</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>were placed, set</em>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:9\" href=\"/Daniel.7.9\">7:9</a> (cf. 𝔗 <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 1:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.1.15\">Je 1:15</a> Dr, and BH <span dir=\"rtl\">ירה</span> <strong>2</strong>).<br><strong>Hithpe.</strong>  <em>be cast</em>, subj. pers. c. ל loc.: Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִתְרְמֵא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:6\" href=\"/Daniel.3.6\">Dn 3:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:11\" href=\"/Daniel.3.11\">11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:8\" href=\"/Daniel.6.8\">6:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:13\" href=\"/Daniel.6.13\">13</a>; 2 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּתְרְמוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:15\" href=\"/Daniel.3.15\">3:15</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, רעה","prev":"BDB Aramaic, רֵיחַ²"}